What is derived:

  agent_migrate/secrets.py - the credential detection rule set is a port of
  entangle's internal/redact/redact.go. Thirteen of its fourteen rules were
  carried over (the `bearer` rule was not). The suppression layer
  (NOT_A_SECRET, ELIDED) and the refuse-rather-than-mask behaviour are not
  from entangle.

No other code is derived from entangle. This project is otherwise independent
and is not affiliated with or endorsed by that project.
